### SetFanCurve
POST http://localhost:9871/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SetFanCurve",
  "method": "SetFanCurve",
  "args":[
    { "temp": 60, "speed": 1500 },
    { "temp": 80, "speed": 3000 },
    { "temp": 100, "speed": 5800 }
  ]
}
